The '''Grand Library''' is a [[Location]] within the {{Zone|Royal Palace}} of the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Overview ==
The '''Grand Library''' features three main [[NPCs]], including a {{NPCSprite|Castle Guard}}, {{NPCSprite|Dalbrek}}, who talks about the [[Cult of the Fallen Star]], and {{NPCSprite|Tal Ker}}, who talks a lot. The left side of the library leads to a room with the {{NPCSprite|Puzzler}}, who allows the player to gain daily {{Mithril Powder}}.

